  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3aee3efd204a6dfc",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 现已推出稳定版并正式全面可用 - Google Developers Blog",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f45bccb27f368530",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 现已推出稳定版并正式全面可用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8513bc01143f6f4d",
      "translationZh": "Logan Kilpatrick 产品管理组经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cf8ffc8d3eb511a",
      "translationZh": "Zach Gleicher Google DeepMind 产品团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a573e3866b8ca31",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们发布 Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 的稳定版，这是 Gemini 2.5 模型系列中速度最快、成本最低的模型（输入价格为每 1M $0.10，输出价格为每 1M $0.40）。我们打造 2.5 Flash-Lite，旨在推动每美元所能获得的智能水平的前沿；它具备原生推理能力，可按需开启，以应对要求更高的使用场景。在 2.5 Pro 和 2.5 Flash 的发展势头之上，这款模型进一步完善了我们已可用于大规模生产环境的 2.5 模型阵容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37573201a572eeb1",
      "translationZh": "我们迄今成本效益最高、速度最快的 2.5 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ee0de6bead24655",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 在性能与成本之间取得平衡，同时不牺牲质量，尤其适用于翻译和分类等对延迟敏感的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26eab60fe85620ff",
      "translationZh": "以下是它的突出之处：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bc68b77ae6d7939",
      "translationZh": "同类最佳速度：在广泛抽取的提示词样本上，Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 的延迟低于 2.0 Flash-Lite 和 2.0 Flash。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0cf52b3900d5050",
      "translationZh": "成本效益：这是我们迄今成本最低的 2.5 模型，定价为每 1M 输入 token $0.10，输出 token $0.40，让你能够以实惠的成本处理大量请求。我们还将音频输入价格较预览版发布时降低了 40%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06a08bb5503941af",
      "translationZh": "智能且小巧：在涵盖编程、数学、科学、推理和多模态理解的广泛基准测试中，它的整体表现均优于 2.0 Flash-Lite。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "719a073754012bf0",
      "translationZh": "功能齐全：使用 2.5 Flash-Lite 构建应用时，你可以使用 100 万 token 的上下文窗口、可控的思考预算，以及 Grounding with Google Search、Code Execution 和 URL Context 等原生工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c1d4e68c1a1aedd",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 的实际应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d928f82a457dfecb",
      "translationZh": "自 2.5 Flash-Lite 发布以来，我们已经看到一些极为成功的部署案例，以下是我们最喜欢的几个：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dea295d0ba94b6c",
      "translationZh": "Satlyt 正在构建一个去中心化的太空计算平台，将改变卫星数据的处理和利用方式，用于在轨遥测数据的实时摘要、自主任务管理以及卫星间通信解析。与其基线模型相比，2.5 Flash-Lite 的速度使关键星载诊断的延迟降低了 45%，功耗降低了 30%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e530203d93c72698",
      "translationZh": "HeyGen 使用 AI 为视频内容创建虚拟形象，并利用 Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 自动完成视频规划、分析和优化内容，以及将视频翻译成超过 180 种语言。这使他们能够为用户提供全球化、个性化的体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4da71bc30fbab674",
      "translationZh": "DocsHound 使用 Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 处理长视频，并以低延迟提取数千张截图，从而将产品演示转化为文档。与传统方法相比，这能更快地将视频素材转化为全面的文档和 AI 智能体训练数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96274f11df99d901",
      "translationZh": "Evertune 帮助品牌了解它们在各个 AI 模型中是如何被呈现的。Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 为他们带来了颠覆性的变化，大幅加快了分析和报告生成速度。其快速的性能使他们能够迅速扫描并综合大量模型输出，为客户提供动态、及时的洞察。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13e519f2d795da2e",
      "translationZh": "你可以在代码中指定“gemini-2.5-flash-lite”，开始使用 2.5 Flash-Lite。如果你正在使用预览版，可以切换到“gemini-2.5-flash-lite”，它使用的是同一个底层模型。我们计划于 8 月 25 日移除 Flash-Lite 的预览版别名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa110230c9eaae3b",
      "translationZh": "准备好开始构建了吗？现在就到 Google AI Studio 和 Vertex AI 中试用 Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite 的稳定版吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61eb832d552cb5de",
      "translationZh": "AI 案例研究 社区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3503ab6e31919085",
      "translationZh": "使用深度学习和 Keras 解码宇宙信号",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "885070dc3b61dfe0",
      "translationZh": "AI 云 公告 最佳实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfdcafc5e5eca878",
      "translationZh": "使用 Google 的 Agent Development Kit 构建零信任 AI 智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23f70267e5816259",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Web AI 教程 操作指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30ea8fe40ced9439",
      "translationZh": "借助 Gemini 将创意提示转化为交互式 XR 体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77f241d1c6158bba",
      "translationZh": "在 Cloud TPU 上实现长上下文多模态嵌入推理的企业级精度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
